{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a neon mech arena brawl!</strong><br>This is a fast-paced 2D top-down action game where you pilot a combat mech and fight off waves of hostile robots. Every battle is a test of survival, reflexes, and smart upgrade choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends elements of <i>arena shooter</i>, <i>roguelike</i>, and <i>survivor-style</i> gameplay, inspired by hits like <strong>Vampire Survivors</strong> and <strong>Hotline Miami</strong>. Each run is unique \u2014 collect upgrades, build your mech, and fight through the chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Upgrade your mech</strong>: choose powerful enhancements after each wave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Face enemy hordes</strong>: from light drones to heavy war machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Intense action</strong>: fast, brutal, and unforgiving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Pixel art visuals</strong>: stylish retro graphics with a neon twist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple controls</strong>: easy to pick up, hard to master.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the quickest will survive. Can you make it to the end?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New user detected","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3751810/8ff334b3a2e636ae9011b0dd8d1474483ea7f33f.jpg"},{"name":"Eradicator\u201110","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3751810/f32243151f14e8e88b32662b03842faf02077639.jpg"},{"name":"Eradicator\u201150","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3751810/db259ea5dc52fff209e3cb3ce05db89eb20d42d4.jpg"},{"name":"Eradicator\u2011100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3751810/9cdb87fd8e4e16c881e